text="HEARTH20 DEVELOPMENT CHECKPOINT

An isolated Hearth20 top-down source candidate is available in this checkout.
The default project still stops here while native rendered acceptance and the
full Lite sheet, import, homebrew, and DM outcome flows remain incomplete.

This gate starts no inherited Lite autoloads, campaign, network session, or
updater. Open hearth20_main.tscn explicitly only with disposable Hearth20 user
data. Do not replace this gate for a portable build until native acceptance
and the owner-reviewed baseline checkpoint are complete.

Return to Develop Hearth20.cmd to continue."
